    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "Apple supports the use of Bluetooth Low Energy (LE) hearing aids.",
      "ko": "Apple은 Bluetooth Low Energy (LE) 보청기 사용을 지원합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "2770d1ad192787e3de4d9a48db78ce754faaebdd21e41d3a2c7c852885a38129",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "Apps don’t have control over routing to these devices.",
      "ko": "앱은 이러한 디바이스에 대한 라우팅을 제어할 수 없습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "83756dcf086ff41280057715bf838c0882a3b48b36409d26a1beb8c1a16a6879",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0003",
      "source": "Instead, the system automatically decides when routing to Bluetooth LE is appropriate.",
      "ko": "대신 시스템이 Bluetooth LE 라우팅이 적절한지 자동으로 결정합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "351d10604dfec9df9fcf06ee7886ce029c347938168846dd1aafea13d7e43d91",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "To determine if audio is being routed to a Bluetooth LE device, inspect the current audio route and look for the presence of a Bluetooth LE port, as shown in the following code example.",
      "ko": "오디오가 Bluetooth LE 디바이스로 라우팅되는지 확인하려면 현재 오디오 라우트를 검사하고, 다음 코드 예제에서와 같이 Bluetooth LE 포트의 존재 여부를 확인합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "bd3b747595b3c5c62612a956300c4f97e6f12f439c9d2b69c7c21c79091ebd75",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:code:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "```swift\nvar routingToBLE = false\nlet session = AVAudioSession.sharedInstance()\n// Iterate over the currentRoute's outputs.\nfor portDesc in session.currentRoute.outputs where portDesc.portType == .bluetoothLE {\n    routingToBLE = true\n    break\n}\n```",
      "ko": "```swift\nvar routingToBLE = false\nlet session = AVAudioSession.sharedInstance()\n// Iterate over the currentRoute's outputs.\nfor portDesc in session.currentRoute.outputs where portDesc.portType == .bluetoothLE {\n    routingToBLE = true\n    break\n}\n```",
      "sourceHash": "34fede06119943eaf5e1a03f61318a59ce0209bb051da4fad8d07e12d1001b1a",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
